WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.636
Welcome to GroundLog. This is one working day, morning to sign off, on a demo project.

00:00:05.636 --> 00:00:08.388
Sign in with the account you already have.

00:00:08.388 --> 00:00:10.420
There is no password to invent.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:17.814
A new day. The app notices, carries your open items over, and keeps yesterday where it was.

00:00:17.814 --> 00:00:20.484
Start fresh, and this is your daily log.

00:00:20.484 --> 00:00:25.490
A digital field notebook built from cards, already set up for your project.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:31.532
Everything lives inside a project. The chip at the top always tells you which one you are in.

00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:33.650
Firms with several sites switch here.

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:37.710
Set your time in and the day starts tracking itself.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:40.150
Hours and mileage add up on their own.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:43.846
Weather fills itself for your location.

00:00:43.846 --> 00:00:47.292
Temperatures, wind, rain, sunrise and sunset.

00:00:47.292 --> 00:00:48.900
Ready for the report.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:53.193
The compliance checklist keeps your walkdown honest.

00:00:53.193 --> 00:00:58.720
Regulatory flags, a turbid discharge, a storm event, drop straight into the log.

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:04.320
Add the details in your own words. Every text field grows with what you write.

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:08.021
The calendar shows every day you have logged.

00:01:08.021 --> 00:01:12.540
Yesterday is one tap away, and today carries forward what it should.

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:20.600
Every page is one tap away. Map, photos, calendar, and the rest under More. Next, the map.
